  "review_text": "[SPAN: display=block; fontsize=extralarge; fonttype=bold; text=Coming Features and Change Log]\n\nWelcome to Longbox Playback's preview of Coming Attractions and Change Log -- the place where I keep track of what just happened, what's coming, and what's still sitting in the bullpen waiting for Stan to shout \"Face front!\"\n\nThis page is a living roadmap of improvements, upgrades, and future features planned for the site as it grows from its humble 1962 beginnings into... [SPAN: fontsize=small; text=well] ...whatever glorious chaos Marvel becomes next.\n\n[SPAN: fontsize=small; text=(And because even I am capable of receiving a \"Biggest Blunder Award,\" this likely includes bug fixes as well!)]\n\nThink of this as the \"<b>NEXT ISH</b>\" blurb for the website itself.\n\n[DEVNOTE: The following tag will be replaced with the actual text from coming-features.ts file in the Angular static-page component.]\n[DEVNOTE: COMING_FEATURES_TEXT_HERE]\n\n\n[BOTTOM_LINE]\nThis page will grow as the site grows.&nbsp; New ideas will appear, old ideas will get crossed off, and some features will leapfrog others because inspiration struck at 2 AM.&nbsp; That's the fun of building something issue by issue.\n\nJust like Marvel in the early '60s, we're inventing the universe as we go.\n\n[SPAN: display=block; textalign=center; severity=success; fontsize=extralarge; fonttype=bold-italic; text=Excelsior!]"
}